) VALUES (
    'maren-lundby-profile',
    '{"en": "Maren Lundby: Pioneering Women''s Ski Jumping", "de": "Maren Lundby: Pionierin des Damen-Skispringens", "fr": "Maren Lundby : Pionnière du saut à ski féminin", "it": "Maren Lundby: Pioniera del salto con gli sci femminile", "es": "Maren Lundby: Pionera del salto de esquí femenino", "pt": "Maren Lundby: Pioneira do salto de esqui feminino", "nl": "Maren Lundby: Pionier van het vrouwen schansspringen", "ar": "مارين لوندبي: رائدة القفز على الجليد للسيدات", "ja": "マーレン・ルンビ：女子スキージャンプのパイオニア", "zh": "Maren Lundby: Nvzi Huaxue Tiaoyue Xianqu", "ko": "마렌 룬드비: 여자 스키점프의 개척자"}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "The Norwegian champion has been instrumental in elevating women''s ski jumping to new heights. A major title winner and role model for the next generation.", "de": "Die norwegische Championne war maßgeblich daran beteiligt, das Damen-Skispringing auf neue Höhen zu heben.", "fr": "La championne norvégienne a joué un rôle déterminant dans l''élévation du saut à ski féminin.", "it": "La campionessa norvegese è stata determinante nell''elevare il salto con gli sci femminile a nuove vette.", "es": "La campeona noruega ha sido fundamental en elevar el salto de esquí femenino a nuevas alturas.", "pt": "A campeã norueguesa foi fundamental para elevar o salto de esqui feminino a novos patamares.", "nl": "De Noorse kampioene is instrumenteel geweest in het verheffen van vrouwen schansspringen naar nieuwe hoogten.", "ar": "كانت البطلة النرويجية أساسية في رفع القفز على الجليد للسيدات إلى آفاق جديدة", "ja": "ノルウェーのチャンピオンは、女子スキージャンプを新たな高みへ引き上げるのに貢献しました。", "zh": "Nuowei guanjun zai ba nvzi huaxue tiaoyue tisheng dao xin gaodu fangmian qile zhongyao zuoyong.", "ko": "노르웨이 챔피언은 여자 스키점프를 새로운 높이로 끌어올리는 데 중요한 역할을 했습니다."}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "<p>Maren Lundby has been one of the most important figures in women''s <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">ski jumping</a>. The Norwegian champion has won major titles and helped elevate the sport''s profile while inspiring countless young athletes.</p><h2>Major Champion</h2><p>Lundby''s trophy case includes some of the most prestigious titles in ski jumping. Her performances on the biggest stages have demonstrated that women''s ski jumping belongs at the highest level of winter sports.</p><p>World Cup overall victories and championship medals confirm her status as one of the sport''s all-time greats.</p><h2>Technical Excellence</h2><p>Lundby''s jumping technique is characterized by exceptional power and control. Her ability to generate speed on the in-run and maintain perfect form through the flight phase produces consistently long jumps.</p><p>She excels on hills of all sizes, adapting her approach to maximize performance in varying conditions.</p><h2>Growing the Sport</h2><p>Beyond her competitive achievements, Lundby has been a powerful advocate for women''s ski jumping. Her success has helped attract sponsors, media coverage, and new participants to the sport.</p><p>She competes against rising stars like <a href=\"/nika-prevc-profile/\">Nika Prevc</a> and <a href=\"/katharina-schmid-profile/\">Katharina Schmid</a>, representing an era of fierce competition in women''s jumping.</p><h2>Norwegian Legacy</h2><p>Norway''s ski jumping tradition extends to the women''s side thanks in large part to Lundby''s success. She has inspired a generation of Norwegian girls to take up the sport.</p><h2>Competitive Spirit</h2><p>Lundby''s determination and competitiveness have defined her career. She continues to push herself and the sport forward, cementing her legacy as a true pioneer.</p>", "de": "<p>Maren Lundby ist eine der wichtigsten Figuren im Damen-<a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">Skisprung</a>. Die norwegische Championne hat große Titel gewonnen und dazu beigetragen, das Profil des Sports zu erhöhen.</p><h2>Große Championne</h2><p>Lundbys Trophäenschrank enthält einige der prestigeträchtigsten Titel im Skisprung.</p><h2>Technische Exzellenz</h2><p>Lundbys Sprungtechnik zeichnet sich durch außergewöhnliche Kraft und Kontrolle aus.</p><h2>Den Sport wachsen lassen</h2><p>Sie kämpft gegen aufstrebende Stars wie <a href=\"/nika-prevc-profile/\">Nika Prevc</a> und <a href=\"/katharina-schmid-profile/\">Katharina Schmid</a>.</p>", "fr": "<p>Maren Lundby a été l''une des figures les plus importantes du <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">saut à ski</a> féminin. La championne norvégienne a remporté des titres majeurs et contribué à élever le profil du sport.</p><h2>Grande championne</h2><p>La vitrine de Lundby comprend certains des titres les plus prestigieux du saut à ski.</p><h2>Excellence technique</h2><p>La technique de saut de Lundby se caractérise par une puissance et un contrôle exceptionnels.</p><h2>Concurrence</h2><p>Elle affronte des étoiles montantes comme <a href=\"/nika-prevc-profile/\">Nika Prevc</a> et <a href=\"/katharina-schmid-profile/\">Katharina Schmid</a>.</p>", "it": "<p>Maren Lundby è stata una delle figure più importanti nel <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">salto con gli sci</a> femminile. La campionessa norvegese ha vinto titoli importanti e contribuito a elevare il profilo dello sport.</p><h2>Grande campionessa</h2><p>La bacheca di Lundby include alcuni dei titoli più prestigiosi nel salto con gli sci.</p><h2>Eccellenza tecnica</h2><p>La tecnica di salto di Lundby è caratterizzata da potenza e controllo eccezionali.</p>", "es": "<p>Maren Lundby ha sido una de las figuras más importantes en el <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">salto de esquí</a> femenino. La campeona noruega ha ganado títulos importantes y ayudado a elevar el perfil del deporte.</p><h2>Gran campeona</h2><p>La vitrina de Lundby incluye algunos de los títulos más prestigiosos en el salto de esquí.</p>", "pt": "<p>Maren Lundby tem sido uma das figuras mais importantes no <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">salto de esqui</a> feminino. A campeã norueguesa ganhou títulos importantes e ajudou a elevar o perfil do esporte.</p><h2>Grande campeã</h2><p>A vitrine de Lundby inclui alguns dos títulos mais prestigiados no salto de esqui.</p>", "nl": "<p>Maren Lundby is een van de belangrijkste figuren in het vrouwen <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">schansspringen</a>. De Noorse kampioene heeft grote titels gewonnen en geholpen het profiel van de sport te verhogen.</p><h2>Grote kampioene</h2><p>Lundbys prijzenkast bevat enkele van de meest prestigieuze titels in het schansspringen.</p>", "ar": "<p>كانت مارين لوندبي واحدة من أهم الشخصيات في <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">القفز على الجليد</a> للسيدات. فازت البطلة النرويجية بألقاب كبرى وساعدت في رفع مستوى الرياضة.</p><h2>بطلة كبيرة</h2><p>تضم خزانة جوائز لوندبي بعضاً من أرقى الألقاب في القفز على الجليد.</p>", "ja": "<p>マーレン・ルンビは、女子<a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">スキージャンプ</a>で最も重要な人物の一人です。ノルウェーのチャンピオンは主要なタイトルを獲得し、スポーツのプロフィールを高めるのに貢献しました。</p><h2>主要チャンピオン</h2><p>ルンビのトロフィーケースには、スキージャンプで最も権威あるタイトルが含まれています。</p>", "zh": "<p>Maren Lundby shi nvzi <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">huaxue tiaoyue</a> zhong zui zhongyao de renwu zhiyi. Nuowei guanjun yingqu le zhuyao guanjun, bing bangzhu tisheng le yundong de zhiming du.</p><h2>Da guanjun</h2><p>Lundby de jiangbei zhong baokuo huaxue tiaoyue zhong zuiju shengwang de yixie guanjun.</p>", "ko": "<p>마렌 룬드비는 여자 <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">스키점프</a>에서 가장 중요한 인물 중 하나입니다. 노르웨이 챔피언은 주요 타이틀을 획득하고 스포츠의 인지도를 높이는 데 기여했습니다.</p><h2>주요 챔피언</h2><p>룬드비의 트로피 케이스에는 스키점프에서 가장 권위 있는 타이틀이 포함되어 있습니다.</p>"}'::jsonb,
    'athlete-profile',
    'SJ',
    '{"en": "Maren Lundby profile - Norwegian women''s ski jumping champion and pioneer who has elevated the sport while winning major titles and inspiring new generations.", "de": "Maren Lundby Profil - Norwegische Damen-Skisprung-Championne und Pionierin.", "fr": "Profil de Maren Lundby - Championne norvégienne et pionnière du saut à ski féminin.", "it": "Profilo di Maren Lundby - Campionessa norvegese e pioniera del salto con gli sci femminile.", "es": "Perfil de Maren Lundby - Campeona noruega y pionera del salto de esquí femenino.", "pt": "Perfil de Maren Lundby - Campeã norueguesa e pioneira do salto de esqui feminino.", "nl": "Maren Lundby profiel - Noorse vrouwen schansspringen kampioene en pionier.", "ar": "ملف مارين لوندبي - بطلة ورائدة القفز على الجليد للسيدات النرويجية", "ja": "マーレン・ルンビのプロフィール - ノルウェーの女子スキージャンプチャンピオンでパイオニア", "zh": "Maren Lundby jianjie - Nuowei nvzi huaxue tiaoyue guanjun he xianqu", "ko": "마렌 룬드비 프로필 - 노르웨이 여자 스키점프 챔피언이자 개척자"}'::jsonb,
